        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Can you clarify what you mean by **“Text to macro3 to gs”**?\n\nA few possibilities (tell me which one fits 👇):\n\n1. **Text → Macro (v3) → Google Apps Script (GS)**  \n   - You want plain text (like chatbot dialogue or rules) converted into a **Macro-style structure**, then exported as **Google Apps Script**.\n\n2. **Macro3** = a **specific tool / format / software**  \n   - If yes, please tell me:\n     - What platform uses *Macro3*?\n     - Any example of Macro3 syntax?\n\n3. **Chatbot rules**  \n   - You want **text-based chatbot flows** converted into:\n     - a macro logic format  \n     - then into **one plug-and-play `.gs` file** (menus, functions, dialogs)\n\n4. **Spreadsheet macro → GS**\n   - Text → spreadsheet macro logic → Google Apps Script automation.\n\n👉 **Please answer these two things only:**\n- What is **Macro3** (tool or format)?\n- What should the **final GS file do** (chatbot, automation, menu, form, etc.)?\n\nOnce I know that, I’ll generate the **exact working Google Apps Script code** for you."
          ]
        },
